{"id":"14d4458c29","t":"Global Awakening: I’m a Necromancer, and I Alone Am a Disaster","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/3f40afdf67dde0e983c3464a4a3dce85-193x278.png","n":9,"l":9,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster","mg":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster"},"u":1795078004060,"desc":"في عصرٍ يُوقظ فيه كلُّ إنسانٍ فئةً فريدةً من نوعها، يوقظ وي شياولي فئته الخفية وهي مستدعي الموتى. وإلى جانبها، ينال موهبةً من الرتبة SSS تُدعى الخُلود، وسلاحًا مرتبطًا بروحه، وهو مجرفة تحمل اسم مرثية الراحلين. وبفضل هذه القدرات المروّعة، يشقّ وي شياولي طريقه سريعًا نحو المجد، حتى يغدو أسطورةً ذائعة الصيت، ويصبح مجرّد ذكر اسمه كفيلًا ببثّ الرعب المطلق في قلوب عددٍ لا يُحصى من الوحوش الجبّارة التي تجوب أرجاء العالم.","type":"ويبتون","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","بطل غير اعتيادى","خارق للطبيعه","خيال","دموى","غموض","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster","mg":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/1/"},"2":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/2/"},"3":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/3/"},"4":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/4/","mg":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|"},"5":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/5/"},"6":{"ml":"global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster|/manga/global-awakening-im-a-necromancer-and-i-alone-am-a-disaster/6/"},"7":{"ml":